    15                                  ;
    16                                  ; Program Information:
    17                                  ; Name: Vehicle Speed
    18                                  ; Languages: C++ and x86-64 assembly, with a Bash build script
    19                                  ; Start Date: 2026-08-27
    20                                  ; Completion Date: 2026-09-
    21                                  ;
    22                                  ; Program's Purpose:
    23                                  ; Vehicle Speed obtains GPS measurements for the delivery route from Fullerton to
    24                                  ; Mission Viejo to Long Beach and back to Fullerton. It computes total driving time
    25                                  ; and average road speed for the complete route.
    26                                  ;
    27                                  ; This File:
    28                                  ; File: delivery.asm
    29                                  ; Function: expressdelivery
    30                                  ; Purpose: Collect six GPS values, calculate route totals, display the results, and
    31                                  ;          return the route's average speed to the C++ driver.
    32                                  ; Language: x86-64 assembly
    33                                  ; Syntax: Intel
    34                                  ; Assembler: NASM
    35                                  ; Assemble Command: nasm -f elf64 -l delivery.lis -o delivery.o delivery.asm
    36                                  ;
    37                                  ; Development Information:
    38                                  ; Platform: Linux x86-64
    39                                  ; Process: Edit, assemble, compile, link, execute, and verify sample results
    40                                  ; Tools: NASM assembler, GNU g++ compiler/linker, and a text editor
    41                                  ; Files: main.cpp, delivery.asm, macro.inc, r.sh
    42                                  ; Status: Completed and tested
    43                                  
    44                                  
    45                                  ; Declaration Section
    46                                  
